Author: google-labs-jules[bot] <161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Thu Jun 18 14:09:47 2026 +0000

    feat: add case based learning paraclinicals and custom topics

    - Adds `topics` array to `UserProfile` type and settings UI for managing topics.
    - Updates `SimulatorLab` to allow dynamic generation of cases based on custom topics, leveraging a new `/api/cases/generate-topic` backend endpoint.
    - Adds a "Paraclinicals" viewer to the `HistoryFeed` UI, presenting pathological and biochemical basis targets and pharmacological data.
    - Introduces `/api/paraclinicals` to process disease and management plan information using the Open Targets GraphQL API and the NIH RxNav REST API.

    Co-authored-by: chxmxth <138705908+chxmxth@users.noreply.github.com>

